---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact Ryan’s Rolfing | Book in Folsom, CA" description="Book Rolfing Structural Integration or Somatic Experiencing with Ryan Caputi at Ryan’s Rolfing, 101 Parkshore Drive in Folsom, CA.">
  <section class="px-5 py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#8b642f]">Contact</p>
      <h1 class="mt-5 text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-7xl">Ready when your body is.</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-xl leading-9 text-[#6f6258]">Book online, join the waitlist, send a question, or find the office in Folsom.</p>
      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
        <a class="rounded-3xl border border-[#e8dcc7] bg-[#fffaf1] p-6 hover:border-[#c4924a]" href="https://rolfing-106793.square.site"><strong>Book / Waitlist</strong><br /><span class="text-[#6f6258]">Square appointments</span></a>
        <a class="rounded-3xl border border-[#e8dcc7] bg-[#fffaf1] p-6 hover:border-[#c4924a]" href="mailto:info@ryansrolfing.com"><strong>Email</strong><br /><span class="text-[#6f6258]">info@ryansrolfing.com</span></a>
        <a class="rounded-3xl border border-[#e8dcc7] bg-[#fffaf1] p-6 hover:border-[#c4924a]" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=101+Parkshore+Drive+Folsom+CA+95630"><strong>Office</strong><br /><span class="text-[#6f6258]">101 Parkshore Drive, Folsom</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl bg-[#fffaf1] p-6 text-[#6f6258]">
        <h2 class="text-3xl text-[#545454]">A note about availability</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Ryan is often booked several weeks in advance. If Square does not show an immediate opening, please join the waitlist in Square. Earlier appointments do become available when cancellations or schedule changes happen.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-8">If you are unsure where to start, email Ryan and he can help you choose the best next step.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
